idate — and is not assigned to this specific green silhouette.\n"], 'condensed_response': '**Scene Summary (Frames\u202f0010\u202f–\u202f0014)**  \n\n| Timestamp | Visual focus | Green‑silhouette label | Other notable labels |\n|-----------|--------------|------------------------|----------------------|\n| **0010**  | Bottom row, second‑from‑right green figure sits under the brown/orange “Female\u202fwinner” icon. | *No label* (only the “Female\u202fwinner” tag is visible). | – |\n| **0011‑0014** | Same green figure remains in place. | **“8th\u202fplace”** appears directly beneath the silhouette and stays unchanged through 0014. | In **0014**, an **“11th\u202fplace”** tag shows up, but it is placed on the female reporter’s portrait to the right of the graphic—not on any green figure. |\n\n**Key points for the asked questions**\n\n1. **Label below the green character (0010‑0014):** “8th\u202fplace”, first visible in frame\u202f0011 and unchanged thereafter.  \n2. **Label in frame\u202f0073:** The frame isn’t provided, so we cannot see it directly. Based on the pattern, the green figure is expected to still carry “8th\u202fplace”; the “11th\u202fplace” tag seen in 0014 is tied to the reporter, not the green silhouette.  \n3. **Label change between earlier frames and 0073:** No change is evident in the supplied frames; the green character stays “8th\u202fplace”. Without frame\u202f0073 we can’t confirm any alteration, but the existing sequence suggests none.  \n4. **Location of “11th\u202fplace” in frame\u202f0073:** In the closest available frame (0014), “11th\u202fplace” is **not** on the green silhouette—it sits on the female reporter’s image. If frame\u202f0073 follows the same layout, the “11th\u202fplace” annotation would likely be elsewhere, not on the green character.\n\n**Overall conclusion:** The green silhouette under the “Female\u202fwinner” consistently carries the “8th\u202fplace” label throughout frames\u202f0010‑0014, with no visual evidence of a label change. The “11th\u202fplace” text appears separately (on the reporter) and does not apply to this green character.', 'failed_images': [['/mnt/ssd/data/longvideobench/videos_processed_1/kONR5_mHofA/frames/frame_0073.jpg', 'File not found']]}}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': '{\n    "tool": "SUBTITLE_SEARCH",\n    "query": "numbers sha finished 11th but by coming",\n    "topk": 10\n}'}, {'role': 'subtitle search results', 'content': 'Found 10 matching subtitle(s) for query: \'numbers sha finished 11th but by coming\'\n(Ranked by semantic similarity using embeddings)\n\n[#1] Score: 1.000 | Frame 73 (1:13)\n    Text: "numbers sha finished 11th but by coming"\n    Time: 73.59s - 73.60s\n    Frame path: frames/frame_0073.jpg\n\n[#2] Score: 0.542 | Frame 57 (0:57)\n    Text: "difference under the quota system one"\n    Time: 57.67s - 57.68s\n    Frame path: frames/frame_0057.jpg\n\n[#3] Score: 0.540 | Frame 49 (0:49)\n    Text: "me sha ran for a seat two years ago she"\n    Time: 49.39s - 49.40s\n    Frame path: frames/frame_0049.jpg\n\n[#4] Score: 0.529 | Frame 14 (0:14)\n    Text: "foundation for the strong showing but"\n    Time: 14.95s - 14.96s\n    Frame path: frames/frame_0014.jpg\n\n[#5] Score: 0.521 | Frame 134 (2:14)\n    Text: "assembly members was about 15% in the"\n    Time: 134.47s - 134.48s\n    Frame path: frames/frame_0134.jpg\n\n[#6] Score: 0.519 | Frame 70 (1:10)\n    Text: "elected based on Raw vote"\n    Time: 70.31s - 70.32s\n    Frame path: frames/frame_0070.jpg\n\n[#7] Score: 0.514 | Frame 145 (2:25)\n    Text: "that had gotten less attention from"\n    Time: 145.07s - 145.08s\n    Frame path: frames/frame_0145.jpg\n\n[#8] Score: 0.504 | Frame 88 (1:28)\n    Text: "involved"\n    Time: 88.92s - 91.03s\n    Frame path: frames/frame_0088.jpg\n\n[#9] Score: 0.503 | Frame 139 (2:19)\n    Text: "1990s it had climbed to 37% by"\n    Time: 139.47s - 139.48s\n    Frame path: frames/frame_0139.jpg\n\n[#10] Score: 0.501 | Frame 11 (0:11)\n    Text: "quarter