male winner” character (i.e., the bottom-right green silhouette) has **no label** beneath it.\n\nIn frame **0014**, the label **“8th place”** appears directly beneath that same green character (bottom-right).\n\n> **Conclusion for Q1**: In frames 0010–0013, there is **no label**. In frame 0014, the label **“8th place”** appears.\n\n---\n\n**2) What label appears below this same green character in frame 0073 when the subtitle 'numbers sha finished 11th but by coming' is shown?**\n\n⚠️ **Important Note**: Frame **0073 is not included** in the set of 12 frames you provided (which only go up to frame 0014). Therefore, **it is impossible to determine what label appears below the green character in frame 0073** based on the available visual data.\n\n> **Conclusion for Q2**: **Cannot be determined** — frame 0073 is not provided.\n\n---\n\n**3) Is there any change in labeling of this specific green character between the earlier frames and frame 0073?**\n\nSince frame 0073 is not available for review, we cannot compare the labeling in earlier frames (0010–0014) with frame 0073.\n\n> **Conclusion for Q3**: **Cannot be determined** — frame 0073 is not provided.\n\n---\n\n**4) Where exactly is the '11th place' text located in each frame?**\n\nIn frames **0011, 0012, and 0013**, the text **“11th place”** appears in an **orange box** located **to the right of the graphic**, **aligned with the bottom row of silhouettes**, and positioned **next to the female news anchor’s image** — not directly under any green silhouette.\n\nIn frame **0014**, the text **“11th place”** appears **directly beneath the bottom-left green silhouette** (i.e., the first silhouette in the bottom row), and is now displayed in an **orange box**.\n\n> **Conclusion for Q4**:  \n> - In frames **0011–0013**: “11th place” is located **to the right of the graphic**, next to the anchor’s image.  \n> - In frame **0014**: “11th place” is located **beneath the bottom-left green silhouette**.\n\n---\n\n✅ **Final Summary**:\n\n1. In frames 0010–0013: **No label** under the bottom-right green character. In frame 0014: **“8th place”**.\n2. Frame 0073 is **not available** — label cannot be determined.\n3. Comparison with frame 0073 is **not possible** due to missing data.\n4. “11th place” text location:\n   - Frames 0011–0013: **Right of graphic, beside anchor image**.\n   - Frame 0014: **Beneath bottom-left green silhouette**."}], 'formatted_responses': ["\n=== Batch 0-12 (5 frames) ===\nFrames: /mnt/ssd/data/longvideobench/videos_processed_1/kONR5_mHofA/frames/frame_0010.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/longvideobench/videos_processed_1/kONR5_mHofA/frames/frame_0011.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/longvideobench/videos_processed_1/kONR5_mHofA/frames/frame_0012.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/longvideobench/videos_processed_1/kONR5_mHofA/frames/frame_0013.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/longvideobench/videos_processed_1/kONR5_mHofA/frames/frame_0014.jpg\nVLM Response: Based on a careful examination of the provided frames, here is the analysis for each of your questions:\n\n---\n\n**1) What label is visible below this green character in frames 0010-0014?**\n\nIn frames **0010 through 0013**, the green character directly beneath the brown/orange “Female winner” character (i.e., the bottom-right green silhouette) has **no label** beneath it.\n\nIn frame **0014**, the label **“8th place”** appears directly beneath that same green character (bottom-right).\n\n> **Conclusion for Q1**: In frames 0010–0013, there is **no label**. In frame 0014, the label **“8th place”** appears.\n\n---\n\n**2) What label appears below this same green character in frame 0073 when the subtitle 'numbers sha finished 11th but by coming' is shown?**\n\n⚠️ **Important Note**: Frame **0073 is not included** in the set of 12 frames you provided (which only go up to frame 0014). Therefore, **it is impossible to determine what label appears below the green character in frame 0073** based on the available visual data.\n\n> **Conclusion for Q2**: **Cannot be determined**